# Modelfile for the Junior Agent coding model.
# Ollama's default context window (2-4k tokens) is far too small for an
# agentic edit/verify loop and silently breaks it mid-task. Raising it here
# (Modelfile PARAMETER takes precedence over the model's baked-in default and
# over OLLAMA_CONTEXT_LENGTH) is the single most impactful reliability fix.
#
# Pick the model that fits your GPU box VRAM and set it as MODEL_TAG in serve.sh:
#   >=24GB : qwen3-coder:30b   (best autonomous multi-file edits)
#   16-24GB: qwen3-coder:14b or devstral-small
#   <=16GB : qwen3:8b          (minimal viable; weaker on multi-file work)

FROM {{MODEL_TAG}}

PARAMETER num_ctx 65536
PARAMETER temperature 0.2
